  "title": "CATO REPORTS 3Q RESULTS",
  "summary": "CHARLOTTE, N.C. , Nov. 21, 2024 /PRNewswire/ -- The Cato Corporation (NYSE: CATO) today reported a net loss of $15.1 million or ( $0.79 ) per diluted share for the third quarter ended November 2, 2024 , compared to a net loss of $6.1 million or ( $0.30 ) per diluted share for the third quarter",
